WEBVTT

00:00:00.150 --> 00:00:01.331
This is a real DSA session

00:00:01.331 --> 00:00:02.131
in Placiq.

00:00:01.843 --> 00:00:04.893
Step by step, every pointer move

00:00:04.893 --> 00:00:05.693
is visible.

00:00:08.042 --> 00:00:09.696
And the Placement Copilot sees that

00:00:09.696 --> 00:00:11.709
work. Its suggestions come from your

00:00:11.709 --> 00:00:14.309
progress, strengths and weak spots.

00:00:14.669 --> 00:00:16.119
Your work, connected.
